ayer/issues/7996 the problem persist, I can't update it anymore.\r\n\r\nShare the apk as was asked, but didn't receive any feedback, was the problem reported to the manufacturer of the device?\r\n\r\nI update the source and the apk to test the problem here is it.\r\n\r\nThe apk\r\n\r\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1eoy3c_TPDxfxwBw6Q4_qsxkJgQOkVZT_/view?usp=sharing\r\n\r\nThe source repo\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/fgl27/ExoPlayer/commits/dev-v2_mi_test\r\n\r\nThe source zip\r\n\r\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1w1of4t1nis6n3O9vZvCkPwfAnShYf7_h/view?usp=sharing\r\n\r\nHere is the change\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/fgl27/ExoPlayer/commit/1cdfba779cfb8403850c410655e00fa1b951698e\r\n\r\nThis was the head of ExoPlayer dev-v2 branch on the day of the above change\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/commits/9753c3fcfb2e2e7fd878666c3f8aa11cbee9728f\r\n\r\nHere is the result after 10 sec of playback\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/13755892/103610511-22a81580-4eff-11eb-99a7-2c8d02a3f654.png)\r\n\r\nHere is a demonstration on how to use the app and that it works, at least on the emulator on the MIBOX4 will cause the above error\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2RUnSk1nlNo\r\n\r\nBasically what that app does is change the playerView visibility to GONE and back to VISIBLE after 10 second of Player.STATE_READY, with causes a playback error on the device.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","org